    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNoSpacing&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The Local Planning Authority is not satisfied that consistent evidence\r\nhas been provided to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the outbuilding\r\nto the rear of 115 Dalston Gardens, Stanmore, Harrow, HA7 1DA, has been in use\r\nas &lt;/span&gt;a self-contained dwelling &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;for a continuous\r\nperiod of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application. The existing\r\ndevelopment is therefore considered to be unlawful and as such the Local\r\nPlanning Authority refuse to issue a Certificate of Lawful Existing\r\nDevelopment.&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
